  "description": "REWPIU crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C78 H84 N18 O37 Tb6 1-,C6 H16 N1 1+,6(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb5 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb6 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.906-4.175 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 106.37-120.41°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Tb6(L6-2H)6(O)(CH3COO)6](HNEt3)(H2O)6. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 6 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
